      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this is part of a wider ongoing concern with Udon exploits, such as clients triggering seemingly arbitrary Udon scripts from the world (such as teleporting all players, if the world has a teleport script) and overriding instance master-only locked controls (as if the controls were unlocked). @{5b4cfe34e2f8bb53f6847f7b|full_name} or @{675b6c8a6eeeb08c94d5d510|full_name} might know more about this (please come forward).\n\nNobody's provided instructions to reproduce the exploit in public yet (and for good reasons). There's only logs of client users triggering exploits and associated UdonVM errors ([ticket #5657075](https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests/657075)).\n\nA few of these clients are launched under GNU/Linux distros, where EAC is running in non-strict mode and can be bypassed more easily.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
