      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} Those exploits have only ever existed because people make networked methods that dont need to be networked, the most known one was when vrchat published a creator economy example for launching a group popup that got exploited in the pug, but I would expect a higher level of checks on worlds that have access to the partner sdk for these kind of mistakes..",
